                    group -0.615 0.541    0.252   1.29  1.0 0.26
frailty(data$id, distribu                       270.92 81.2 0.00

      exp(coef) exp(-coef) lower .95 upper .95
group     0.541       1.85     0.187      1.56

Iterations: 9 outer, 18 Newton-Raphson
