answer.

 

I have a set of data measured on individual animals where the 
response is the proportion of time spent feeding, and a list of predictors that 
characterise the animal being observed (sex, age etc).  I have analysed the 
data using the quasi-family of GLMs with a logit link and assumed constant 
variance.  The data are very underdispersed (dispersion parameter = 
0.02).

 

When I am conducting stepwise removals of predictor terms to 
