It's a scope problem.  You meed to assign `simu' in frame one, as in

iter1 <- function(n) {
      assign("simu", arima.sim(n, model=list(ar=0.7)), f = 1)
      est <- arima.mle(simu, model=list(order=c(1,0,0)))
      arima.diag(est, resid=T, plot=F)$resid
}

where I've added some spaces in deference to my readers.

