available to me.  I have successfully compiled this code and run the
functions under both R and Splus3.4.  However under Splus5.1
something strange happens.  The function chiplot() appears to execute
successfully and produces the appropriate graphic, but when the
function finishes executing the cryptic error message

        Terminating S Session: Bus Error signal

